! Fixture for SmithGeneratorImport (brief-smith-1-document.md R-smith1-7 / gate 7).
! SYNTHETIC. Three points, and the reference impedance is deliberately 75 ohms rather than 50, so a
! reader that ignored the file's own stated reference would produce visibly different impedances
! (row 1 would read 16.667 ohms instead of 25) rather than an answer that happens to agree.
!
!   1 GHz   S11 = -0.5 + j0.0   ->  Z =  25 + j0
!   2 GHz   S11 =  0.2 + j0.4   ->  Z =  75 + j75
!   3 GHz   S11 =  0.4 - j0.2   ->  Z = 150 - j75
# GHz S RI R 75
1  -0.5   0.0
2   0.2   0.4
3   0.4  -0.2
